 "author": "naturarum",
 "description": "For dn2-cfw's CMP4 build, whose DSP runs a flanger in the chorus slot and the stock delay in the delay slot: renames the chorus page and every chorus send to Flanger/FLG; every delay name stays stock. fx-rename-dn2's 13 flanger sites with the same strings (they ran on a unit in FTN1 to CMP3), without its tape sites. Labels only: no new rows, knobs or glyphs, and every knob keeps its MIDI CC, storage and DSP frame word. On a stock DSP the chorus would be named Flanger.",
